# Isolated model-export env (C4 / SPEC §11 heavy-ML-closure principle): the
# torch/optimum/onnxruntime/transformers/sentence-transformers closure needed
# to export + parity-gate the Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B ONNX graph is confined here
# (tools/model-export/.export-venv) and NEVER enters the platform lock/SBOM.
# Same isolation pattern as packages/ne-govern/presidio_env and
# packages/ne-brain/parser_env (docling). Compile with:
#
#   uv pip compile tools/model-export/export_env/requirements.in \
#       --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes \
#       -o tools/model-export/export_env/requirements.txt
#
# Pins re-verified live (PyPI JSON API + HF API) 2026-07-17 — all four CURRENT
# latest at pin time, all permissive-license (Apache-2.0 / MIT / BSD-3-Clause
# multi-license), no C4 license-gate exposure:
#   optimum-onnx==0.1.0        Apache-2.0  (2025-12-23; registers qwen3 for
#                               feature-extraction export, huggingface/optimum-onnx#97)
#   onnxruntime==1.27.0        MIT
